name: sim.getIkGroupHandle
description: Retrieves the handle of an IK group.
luaSynopsis: int ikGroupHandle=sim.getIkGroupHandle(string ikGroupName)
inputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. ikGroupName: name of an IK group. If the name is appended by a "@silentError" suffix, then no error will be output if the IK group does not exist.
outputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. Handle of the IK group or -1 if operation was not successful
